WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.416
What would happen if 800 of the world's

00:00:02.416 --> 00:00:04.625
most elite footballers and their managers

00:00:04.625 --> 00:00:06.500
lived together under one roof?

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.958
Well, in the debut season of The Champions, we found out.

00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:13.458
Hi, everyone, and welcome

00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:16.041
to The Champions Season 1 reunion show.

00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:19.041
I’m Kate Abdo here with some of the more noteworthy footballers

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:21.416
and, of course, their managers from this season.

00:00:21.416 --> 00:00:22.333
Hello, everyone.

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:22.958
Hello.

00:00:22.958 --> 00:00:23.541
Hola.

00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:24.333
Bonjour.

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:24.708
Hey, Kate.

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:26.083
Hi, Jose.

00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:27.625
That’s quite an outfit.

00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:29.166
It’s very...decorative.

00:00:29.166 --> 00:00:30.541
It is the MOST decorative.

00:00:30.541 --> 00:00:31.916
I am the most decorated manager.

00:00:31.916 --> 00:00:34.958
So, I have start by asking, how are things between you and Paul?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:35.833
Paul and I are good.

00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:37.500
Last week we even made eye contact.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.291
He knows what I think of him; he is very talented

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:40.541
I just want him to focus.

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:41.500
I am very focused.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:42.750
I am focused on football.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:44.208
I am focused on my rap career.

00:00:44.208 --> 00:00:45.708
I am focused on my shoe deal.

00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:47.458
I am focused on my hair. Commercials.

00:00:47.458 --> 00:00:48.625
I’m focused on all of it.

00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:51.125
Luka, looks like you’ve gone back to your old look

00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:52.875
after your Flair Five makeover?

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:54.000
Da...well

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:54.875
uh..mostly.

00:00:54.875 --> 00:00:56.916
So, what did you learn from that experience?

00:00:56.916 --> 00:00:59.250
I learned that I’m more like a Messi type

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:01.833
like, uh, let my football do the talking, you know.

00:01:01.833 --> 00:01:03.708
I’m the best in La Liga, b---h!

00:01:03.708 --> 00:01:06.208
B---h, I’m better than you with two broken elbows.

00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:08.541
I got the trophy this year, b---h!

00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:10.291
How many jerseys you sell, b---h?

00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:12.458
How about you pay your taxes, and then we talk, b---h!

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:13.500
Riiiight.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.833
Soooooo, who’s next for the Flair Five?

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:18.125
Well, we just spent some time with Fellaini.

00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:21.125
It was actually amazing; we straightened his hair.

00:01:21.666 --> 00:01:22.500
Kevin De Bruyne

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.000
I understand you feel that the show portrayed you a bit unfairly

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.291
made you look simple.

00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:27.708
Do you stand by this?

00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:28.208
Kevin.

00:01:28.208 --> 00:01:28.833
Yea.

00:01:28.833 --> 00:01:30.083
I wonder if you’re the only one?

00:01:30.083 --> 00:01:32.625
Does anyone else feel like they were portrayed unfairly?

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:34.833
I was made to look like a mumbler

00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:37.708
when, in fact, I enunciate quite clearly.

00:01:37.708 --> 00:01:39.000
I’m sorry, and you are?

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:39.916
Harry Kane!

00:01:39.916 --> 00:01:44.041
Captain of the Three Lions and one very HOT spur!

00:01:44.083 --> 00:01:45.875
No, wait a moment, no you’re not.

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:46.500
You’re

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.500
you’re Matthew Crawley from Downton Abbey!

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:50.333
It’s Dan... It's actually Dan Stevens!

00:01:50.333 --> 00:01:52.458
I’m the actor who played Matthew Crawley

00:01:52.458 --> 00:01:54.000
And I’m in other things, you know!

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.000
I played Sir Lancelot in the third Night at the Museum movie!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.458
I can kick a stupid ball just like you.

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:04.000
OK, um, want to shift gears now to Real.

00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:07.791
With Ronaldo gone, who would you say the best player in Madrid?

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:10.041
Moi.

00:02:10.458 --> 00:02:12.041
We run Madrid now

00:02:12.041 --> 00:02:15.166
who needs Galacticos when you have Galacti-Costa?!

00:02:15.208 --> 00:02:16.083
Oh please

00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:18.125
everybody knows you’re just jealous of me

00:02:18.125 --> 00:02:20.125
the real bad boy of La Liga.

00:02:20.125 --> 00:02:22.541
And you’re jealous that we have a real manager!

00:02:22.541 --> 00:02:23.208
Yeah.

00:02:23.208 --> 00:02:24.583
Not gonna argue with that one, yeah.

00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:25.583
Mo, Sergio.

00:02:25.583 --> 00:02:27.333
I noticed you’re still stuck together.

00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:29.583
Sergio, will you ever apologize to Mo

00:02:29.583 --> 00:02:30.916
and just end this curse already?

00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:33.375
I will never apologize for who I am.

00:02:33.375 --> 00:02:34.208
Sorry, Mo.

00:02:34.208 --> 00:02:34.958
At this point

00:02:34.958 --> 00:02:37.041
I understand you will always be a douche

00:02:37.041 --> 00:02:38.083
and I accept that.

00:02:39.166 --> 00:02:39.541
What?

00:02:39.541 --> 00:02:40.041
Woah!

00:02:40.041 --> 00:02:40.708
Nice.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:43.833
Now, one of the unfortunate things about having

00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:47.083
over 800 people in a house is that we can’t feature everyone.

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:49.125
We heard a lot from Galatasaray fans

00:02:49.125 --> 00:02:50.833
that they were hoping to see their club.

00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:53.333
So, let’s bring out SELCUK INAN of Galatasaray!

00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:54.375
Come on out Selcuk.

00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:56.916
Hi, Selcuk.

00:02:56.916 --> 00:02:59.541
Tell me, how is your Champions League season going?

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:01.250
Not great.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:02.875
Well, that’s all very exciting.

00:03:02.875 --> 00:03:04.166
Let’s move on to Dele Alli.

00:03:04.166 --> 00:03:06.791
I hear you’re working on a new Dele Alli challenge?

00:03:06.791 --> 00:03:07.500
Wait a minute

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.041
where are all the Tottenham guys?

00:03:10.458 --> 00:03:12.875
I thought you said you could take us home, Harry?

00:03:12.875 --> 00:03:13.708
Yeah, Harry!

00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:16.166
Take us back to the mansion for the knockout stage.

00:03:16.166 --> 00:03:17.000
I’ll get us home

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.000
don’t worry; I’ll get us home.

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.125
I think it's right here past this...ah!

00:03:19.125 --> 00:03:21.208
Hah! Not if I take Inter home first!

00:03:21.208 --> 00:03:23.458
All we have to do is beat PSV!

00:03:23.458 --> 00:03:25.750
Uh, well, that's definitely not the right way.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:28.416
Wait...this is not the mansion.

00:03:28.416 --> 00:03:29.750
Well, get used to it…

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:32.166
Because this is your new home now!

00:03:32.166 --> 00:03:33.333
Muhahaha!

00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:35.208
Welcome to Europa League!

00:03:35.208 --> 00:03:39.458
It’s not so bad here, but it’s also not so good!

